# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp

# AGENTS.md is committed here on purpose (README points readers at it for
# operational detail) even though it's excluded by many contributors' global
# gitignore (agent-tooling files are usually local-only) — un-ignore it for
# this repo specifically so it stays tracked regardless of that global rule.
!AGENTS.md

# graphify (knowledge graph) — allowlist: commit only graph.json + GRAPH_REPORT.md,
# ignore everything else graphify-out/ produces (exports, caches, bookkeeping)
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md

